      194.87,
      491.3,
      208.01
    ],
    "text": "Mulathivu 01. Manthei East 31.05.2025",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      230.68,
      549.82,
      280.01
    ],
    "text": "02. The Mediation Boards Commission hereby gives notice Calling upon (a) the Individuals,(b) the Bodies, Organizations and Institutions of non political nature, and (c) the District Secretaries/ Divisional Secretaries specified hereinafter to submit names of person who are eligible for appointment as Mediators to the Panel of Mediators for the said Mediation Board areas:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.31,
      290.87,
      549.92,
      316.01
    ],
    "text": "(a) The following Individuals are entitled to submit nominations other than themselves for appointment to the Panel of a particular Mediation Board area:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.31,
      326.87,
      549.82,
      388.01
    ],
    "text": "(i) A Public Officer or a Provincial Public Officer serving as the Head of a Department or as the Regional Head of a Department in an office located within the Administrative District at which that particular Mediation Board area is situated: (ii) A Head of a Place or religious worship or of school situated in that particular Mediation Board area;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.31,
      398.87,
      534.61,
      412.01
    ],
    "text": "(iii) A retired Head of a Department or School principal residing in that particular Mediation Board area;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      422.87,
      264.67,
      436.01
    ],
    "text": "(iv) Chairman of Panel of Mediators.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      446.87,
      549.83,
      472.01
    ],
    "text": "(b) The following Bodies, Organizations and Institutions of Non-political nature are entitled to submit nominations for appointment to the Panel of Mediators of any Mediation Board area:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      482.87,
      549.8,
      508.01
    ],
    "text": "(i) Any board, Organizations or Institution which has been in existence at least for a period of five years and which is engaged in carrying out or doing anyone or more of the under mentioned objectives;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      518.87,
      549.82,
      628.01
    ],
    "text": "(a) The enhancement of educational, religious, moral or spiritual, advancement of the community. (b) The enhancement of social welfare and eradication of poverty. (c) The enhancement of rural or community development. (d) The enhancement of culture of sports. (e) The enhancement of projects, programmes and activities intending providing and supplying basic needs of the peoples such as health, food and shelter etc. (c) The following District Secretaries/Divisional Secretaries are entitled to submit nominations for appointment to the Panel of a particular Mediation Board Area:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      638.87,
      550.06,
      676.01
    ],
    "text": "(i) The District Secretaries of the Administrative District in which that Mediation Board area is situated; (ii) As the Following Persons are entitled to be appointed to the Panel of a particular Mediation Board Area whose names may be so submitted for appointment.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      686.87,
      533.86,
      700.01
    ],
    "text": "(a) any person being a resident in Mediation Board Area and engaged in any work in that Area;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      710.87,
      549.83,
      748.01
    ],
    "text": "(b) Any person resident or engaged in any work outside that Mediation Board Area, However the Commission is of the opinion that such particular person is eligible in exceptional circumstances; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      79.73,
      69.86,
      538.57,
      94.7
    ],
    "text": "3AI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2025'03'03Part I : Sec. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 03.03.2025",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabldBold",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT-SC700"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      98.86,
      542.52,
      136.0
    ],
    "text": "(c) Any Public Officer nominated under this paragraph by the District Secretary of the Administrative District within which that Mediation Board is situated is eligible for appointment to the Panel of Mediators of every Mediation Board area within that Administrative District;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      146.86,
      542.5,
      172.0
    ],
    "text": "(d) The present Chairman, Mediators of Panels of Mediators who are due to vacate post upon the completion of three years.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      182.86,
      542.5,
      208.0
    ],
    "text": "(e) Fulfilling of Minimum requirement as G.C.E. (O/L) is being compulsory for the new nominees other then the members those who holding membership of Mediation Boards already.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      218.86,
      542.48,
      244.0
    ],
    "text": "(f) The minimum age limit of those are to forward nominators afresh should be more than 35 years of age save and except the members presently engage in duties.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      266.86,
      542.51,
      304.0
    ],
    "text": "(g) Nominations of those who are engaged in duties in the field of banking, leasing, micro financing and insurance involving in financial activities both in the government/semi government or private sector will not be considered.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      314.67,
      542.74,
      364.0
    ],
    "text": "03. (a) The Individuals, Boards, Organizations and Institutions referred to in Paragraph 2 above may submit nominations of such persons as are specified in Paragraph 2(a) and 2(b) above who are Public and non-Public Officers including Officers in the Provincial Public Service. Any individual is not entitled to nominate his/her name by himself/herself.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      374.86,
      542.5,
      400.0
    ],
    "text": "(b) District Secretary referred to in Paragraph 2(c) above may submit nominations of Public Officers, of whom not more than five may be appointed by the Commission to the relevant Panel of Mediators.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      410.67,
      167.45,
      424.0
    ],
    "text": "04. Form of Nominations:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      434.86,
      412.68,
      448.0
    ],
    "text": "(a) Individuals should submit nominations substantially in Form (a) below;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      458.86,
      539.98,
      472.0
    ],
    "text": "(b) Boards, Organizations and Institutions should submit nominations substantially in Form (b) below; and.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      482.86,
      537.09,
      496.0
    ],
    "text": "(c) District Secretaries, Divisional Secretaries should submit nominations substantially in Form (c) below;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      506.86,
      542.53,
      616.0
    ],
    "text": "Each nomination should be in a separate form and should without fail contain the recommendation of the nominator as indicated in the next paragraph. 05. The recommendation of the nominator should not be a recommendation without reasons being assigned. It required to set out specific facts and circumstances to enable the Commission to draw its own reference to the suitability or otherwise of the person nominated for appointment to the Panel of Mediators, such as, for instance, his or her present or past occupation, the period of service or engagement in such occupations, any position or trust or responsibility held by him or her and the office, if any, held by him or her in any social service/ religious/charitable Organization, Society or Body.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      626.67,
      542.54,
      664.0
    ],
    "text": "06. An individual or a Body, Organizations or Institution should as far as possible, refrain from making more than three nominations in respect of the same Mediation Board Area. However, this limitation will not apply to the present Chairman of the Panel of Mediators and to the District Secretaries, and Divisional Secretaries.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      674.67,
      542.51,
      700.0
    ],
    "text": "07. All nominations should be forwarded to reach the Secretary, Mediation Boards Commission, Ministry of Justice Building, 4th Floor, No: 19, Sri Sangaraja Mawatha, Colombo 10, Before 30th April 2025.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      710.67,
      542.51,
      736.0
    ],
    "text": "08. The Mediation Boards Commission will, based on the basic qualifications to be checked at interview, select eligible candidates to be offered a preliminary training on Mediation skills and methods.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      70.86,
      515.57,
      93.0
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2025'03'03Part I : Sec. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 03.03.20254A",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabldBold",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT-SC700"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      55.3,
      98.67,
      549.84,
      124.0
    ],
    "text": "09. Final decision in connection with any matter which is not being prevailed by the regulation stipulated in this notice is the decision made by Mediation Boards Commission at any time.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
